14952 – AI Developer (onsite) – Palm Beach Gardens, FL
To apply: https://lnkd.in/ezUYqwNd

Start Date: ASAP
Type: Temporary Project
Estimated Duration: 12 months with possible extensions
Work Setting: 100% of the time at the Client's site. No telecommuting or remote work. This is a non-negotiable requirement from the client

Only candidates able to relocate as required should apply to avoid removal from future consideration.

Our client is filling this contract position exclusively through approved staffing partners, so this opportunity is not available by applying directly with the client. If you're interested, we'd be happy to represent you throughout the hiring process.

Required:
- Availability to work 100% of the time at the Client's site in Palm Beach Gardens, FL (required);
- Experience with Python;
- Experience with software development, AI, machine learning, data science, or related technical roles (0–5 years);
- Experience with data structures and algorithms and object-oriented programming;
- Experience with REST APIs and software development lifecycle methodologies;
- Experience with machine learning concepts, model development, and model evaluation techniques;
- Experience with Generative AI, Agentic AI, Large Language Models (LLMs), or AI orchestration frameworks;
- Experience with source control systems such as Git.
- Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, Data Science, Software Engineering, Information Systems, Artificial Intelligence, or a related technical discipline

Preferred:
- Experience with Azure OpenAI, OpenAI APIs, and Anthropic Claude;
- Experience with LangChain, LangGraph, Semantic Kernel, CrewAI, and AutoGen;
- Experience with TensorFlow, PyTorch, and Scikit-learn;
- Experience with vector databases, embeddings, RAG architectures, and AI agents;
- Experience with AWS or Azure cloud environments;
- Experience with CI/CD pipelines and DevOps practices;
- Experience with integrating AI capabilities into enterprise applications and business workflows;
- Experience with responsible AI, model governance, and AI security principles.

Responsibilities:
- Design, develop, and deploy AI-powered solutions and application features;
- Prepare, cleanse, and transform data and perform feature engineering;
- Develop, test, and maintain AI-driven application features and machine learning models;
- Build proof-of-concepts and production-ready solutions using Generative AI, Agentic AI, LLMs, RAG, and prompt engineering;
- Troubleshoot, debug, and resolve issues within AI solutions and supporting data pipelines;
- Support AI model deployment, monitoring, tuning, and lifecycle management;
- Integrate AI capabilities with enterprise applications and cloud platforms.
